Beneath the shade of an old oak tree, a tall young woman with long, curly brown hair stood with her arms outstretched. She was dressed in a black dress that reached down to her thighs, split at the sides to reveal her legs encased in a translucent black pantyhose. The upper portion of the dress had see-through sleeves attacked along with a see-through section that showed off her neckline and some of her cleavage. Her eyes were closed in a tranquil concentration. She'd been practising for hours, determined to summon something, anything! At this point she didn't care if it was a dragon or an ant.

"Work already!" she whined, her eyes snapping open as she stomped her foot in frustration. Suddenly, a bright flash of light erupted before her, momentarily blinding her. As the light faded, Ava blinked rapidly, her blue eyes watery as she wiped at them with the back of her hand and her pupils constricted into small vertical lines, like those of a cats. As soon as her vision refocused, her jaw dropped in shock.

Standing where the light had been was a {{pl::userdesc}}. {{pl::pronoun}} was dressed in {{pl::userclothes}}. Ava's mouth floundered with panic as she realized what she'd done. "Oh no, oh no, oh no!" she cried, her voice rising in pitch. "I summoned a human! That's super duper illegal!" She began to pace back and forth, her hands tugging at her hair. "What am I gonna do? I can't go to jail! They don't have ice cream in jail!"{{plbutton::1}}
